[[Zhalia Moon]] used Farslip to open numerous doors within the [[Argo]] whilst searching for the [[Hoplite]] [[Amulets]] of [[Jason]]. {{source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}

[[Lok Lambert]] used the spell to call a lift whilst working as a bellboy. {{source|All Work and No Pay}} He again used Farslip to open a drawer in a secret room at the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]], revealing a puzzle left to him by his [[Eathon Lambert|dad]]. {{Source|The Sceptre Deception}}

He later used it to open a hidden passage in an alcove in the [[Castle of Vlad Dracul]], allowing him, [[Cherit]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] to escape from [[Antedeluvian]]. {{source|The Vampire Loses Its Fangs}}

[[Dante Vale]] used the spell to activate a set of traps in the [[Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot]], defeating [[Ammit Heart-Eater]] and [[Sekhmet]]. {{source|Memory Lane}} He later used the spell to unlock the entrance to [[Klaus' bookshop]]. {{source|The Blood Spiral}}

[[Den Fears]] used the spell to splash [[Sophie Casterwill]] with water by firing it at a running sink. {{source|Lok's Leadership}}
